From 40b8bd3ab02185724928b18268ae6ff8ffd04080 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 21:56:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Legendary items roll two random attributes, with reforging

Each Legendary item rolls two different bonus attributes (physical/magic attack, critical
chance, damage reduction, max HP, attack speed, dodge, experience, drop chance). 5% of
rolls are Perfect (max value); two Perfect attributes make a Godly item, announced to
the server. The Legendsmith reforges both attributes for 5 Dragon Shards. Existing
Legendary items roll theirs on their owner's next login. Adds migration LegendaryAffixes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012QZ2EofieBFmMsHF9Yardw
